# This repository is a monorepo, but the multi-runtime image needs only its
# own application, the shared packages, and the workspace manifests. Keeping
# the build context allow-listed avoids sending local Runs, uploads, secrets,
# and dependencies to the Docker daemon.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!packages/
!packages/**
!apps/
!apps/agentloop-app/
!apps/agentloop-app/package.json
!apps/agentloop-multi-runtime/
!apps/agentloop-multi-runtime/**
